A computed expression in a mapping, which slice 1 of the lens language does
not support.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: int
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: int
	b: int
}

forward: {
	b: input.a + 1
}
-- out/error --
b: a mapping is a reference to input, a constant, a nested body, drop, orelse, remap or each; other expressions are not supported yet:
    1.0.thema:7:5
